;; Link's training stage (0.4.37, src/game/tutorial/heroes/link.ts; docs/HEROES.md), in the Zelda II
;; field look: the sword at a straw target, the shield against a shooter (gate 30), a down-thrust on
;; the enemy in the dip (gate 41), an up-thrust into the coin block (gate 49), the boomerang fetching
;; the coin on the high ledge (gate 59), the Heart Container and the Bomb Bag from ? blocks and a bomb
;; at the target (gate 77), the Shield and Jump spells and the tall wall only the Jump spell clears,
;; the Blue Ring in the pen by the palace door where walkers come out (gate 110), the Fire spell's
;; beam across the ditch (gate 128), the Magical Sword's beams (gate 141) and the flagpole. Each
;; power block's item is in [hero-items]; the gates are laid by the tutorial.
id: training-link
name: LINK TRAINING
world: 2
stage: 0
theme: zelda2
music: zelda2-field
time: 400
start: 2,11
startMode: stand
camera: scroll

